                    odrl:action dalicc:modificationNotice ;
                    dalicc:evidence "In fulfillment of these requirements, Contributor must include a file (e.g., a change log file) that describes the alterations made and the date of the alterations, identifies Contributor as originator of the alterations, and consents to characterization of the alterations as a Modification, for example, by including a statement that the Modification is derived, directly or indirectly, from Original Software provided by Government Agency." ],
                [ a odrl:Duty ;
                    odrl:action dalicc:includeNoticeFile ;
                    dalicc:evidence "In fulfillment of these requirements, Contributor must include a file (e.g., a change log file) that describes the alterations made and the date of the alterations, identifies Contributor as originator of the alterations, and consents to characterization of the alterations as a Modification, for example, by including a statement that the Modification is derived, directly or indirectly, from Original Software provided by Government Agency." ],
                [ a odrl:Duty ;
                    odrl:action dalicc:addStatement ] ],
        [ a odrl:Permission ;
